                "loc": "ZEP.2.8+ZEP.2.9+ZEP.2.10+ZEP.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2:8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man in, wod dhanu, cu lembe, man iwac kumae, Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae pi nyithindho mir Amon, man pi cac migi; man iwac kumae, Palamularu, juwodho palamularu, jurude mi negonek, kara ecam, kara ebed calu lukoth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kinde ma gineno ginmawokiwang’ mi ndra piri, man kinde ma giewo lembe mi ndra iri kara gikethi wi ng’ut judubo ma jutong’o lero mi tho i kumgi, ma nindone bino i nindo mi kier mi kajik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keth edok i ukorone. Abipoko lembe i wii i ka ma jucwii i ie, i ng’om mi nyol peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikonjo ng’ecwiny para i wii; abikoto i wii ku mac mi kwinyo para; man abimii i cing’ dhanu ma jurop, ma riek mi nyotho nyoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibibedo ni jambmac ni mac: rimbi bibedo i die ng’om; jubipoi piri kendo ngo; kum an, an a Yehova, ayero maeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
